# ============================================================
# Global LLM-Supervised Reconfiguration of Ground–Low-Altitude
# Mobility under Disruptions  —  HSCC+ICCPS 2027 研究转向
# ============================================================
# 本仓库只跟踪代码、设计、配置、schema、文档与清单。
# 生成数据、原始/转换地图、二进制与大清单 CSV 一律忽略，
# 靠外部备份 + 索引恢复（见 provenance/hscc2027/RESTORE_LEGACY.md）。

# ---- generated experiment artifacts (very large) ----
runs/
outputs/
archive/
tmp/

# ---- large provenance inventory dumps (recoverable from cold storage) ----
provenance/hscc2027/legacy_file_inventory.csv
provenance/hscc2027/legacy_inventory.csv
provenance/hscc2027/observed_run_metrics.json

# ---- raw / converted road-network maps (regenerable; source URL + hash recorded) ----
*.osm
*.osm.xml
*.osm.pbf
*.net.xml
water_osm.json

# ---- vendored native binaries (install via requirements instead) ----
*.exe
*.dll
*.pyd
*.so

# ---- Python ----
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/

# ---- virtualenv / tooling ----
.venv/
venv/
env/

# ---- IDE / OS ----
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ---- logs / caches ----
*.log
.cache/

# ---- secrets / credentials (defensive; real key lives outside the repo) ----
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.credentials.yaml
.credentials.yaml
credentials*.yaml
secrets*.yaml
